WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
10:00 — Large-text home. Margaret’s iPhone home uses larger text so renewals are readable without asking her son to “just read this bit.”

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
14:20 — Documents. Documents list on the same phone holds pension letters she used to lose in the bureau — titles clear, not tiny scan thumbnails.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
16:00 — Son on iPad. iPad on the table while her son helps label files; he can help without taking the papers away in a plastic bag.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
19:00 — Reminders. Laptop reminders for home insurance sit in the study beside the kettle — dates she can actually see.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.500
19:40 — Settings check. Settings on the laptop stay honest: demo labelled, text size kept. She closes the lid feeling organised, not managed.

